 "strings": {
  "Kaito-san is jazzed over the arrival of Adachi-san, his best friend and former partner. He's known Adachi-san since middle school. I can't even imagine a preteen Kaito.": "",
  "Bram Sylvania III": "",
  "An entertainer and self-proclaimed vampire lord. His real name is Otoya Shijima. He says sunlight doesn't hurt because he's a \"progenitor.\" The more I think about that, the less sense it makes.": "",
  "Misaki Hayama": "",
  "Bram Sylvania III's manager. If you ask me, he's more like his nanny. At least he's got Bram on a tight leash to keep him in character and out of trouble.": "",
  "Maki": "",
  "An employee of the bar that charged me ¥100,000. Guess she's one of those Kamurocho scam artists you hear about. Let's face it; I got duped.": "",
  "Tatsuo Tanaka": "",
  "Maki's husband. He was fighting with her, but was that just another act to bring down my guard? If so, he's quite an actor.": "",
  "The suspect and client of this case. He's been a nervous wreck since Saori accused him. I'd better get to the bottom of this cake crime.": "",
  "She was fuming over the cake theft and planned to uncover the truth through a mock trial. If only she'd put that passion into her job.": "",
  "A witness who happened to be at the scene. Hoshino was trying to pin the crime on her. She was pulled into the mock trial too, but was surprisingly down to go along with Saori's nonsense.": "",
  "Shoji Ohata": "",
  "A single father living with his son, Ayumu. He came to ask me to find his kid.": "",
  "Ayumu Ohata": "",
  "A six-year-old boy who loves playing hide-and-seek. One time his dad took days to find him.": "",
  "Kotaro Hyuga": "",
  "An up-and-coming comedian known as \"Horny Hinata.\" Recently tanked his own career by sleeping with a minor.": "",
  "A woman who purportedly lured Horny Hinata in a honey trap. I'll need to investigate, gather evidence, and see what I can shake loose.": "",
  "The Fisherman": "",
  "Publicly, he's the owner of a local pond called Koi Bride. But that's just a front for L'Amant, his underground casino. Even so, he seems fond of his fish, and is acting genuinely enraged by the slicing of his carps.": "",
  "Taeko Nakahara": "",
  "A woman who contacted me on Genda's recommendation. She's energetic and talks a lot. Drawing is her hobby, so she's been taking art classes.": "",
  "A former chef at Sushi Gin who was fired for having a bad attitude. He matches descriptions of the man who stole Nakahara's ring.": "",
  "A mysterious yet undeniably skilled martial artist who challenged me to a duel.": "",
  "The victim of the kidnapping. A fashionable and attractive woman who works in an office.": "",
  "The stalker who kidnapped Nanami after targeting her for a long time.": "",
  "Hironaka": "",
  "Ono Michio's producer. He puts his heart and soul into his production work, and thinks highly of the man who donned the previous mantle of Ono Michio.": "",
  "Ono Michio": "",
  "This orange-headed fisherman is the mascot of Onomichi, Hiroshima. He may look cute, but beneath that dopey smile is a heart of iron and a mind like a steel trap. Smells nice, too.": "",
  "Kenji Sunada": "",
  "A police officer and my client. He keeps going on about how his life depends on the result of this case. I guess I don't want a cop's blood on my hands...": "",
  "Aoi": "",
  "Sunada's girlfriend, who is suspected of infidelity. The only \"evidence,\" however, is that she smelled like another man's hair product. Pretty weak.": "",
  "An inmate at Hokkaido's Abashiri Prison serving time for a murder linked to organized crime that took place three years ago.": "",
  "Portrait of Asami Morimiya": "",
  "A portrait of the missing Asami Morimiya.": "",
  "Tatsuro's Bag": "",
  "A bag that Tatsuro forced on me. There's a lot of junk in this thing. Does he not need it for work?": "",
  "Stylish Paper Bag": "",
  "The paper bag that was in Tatsuro's bag. The stylish design and logo both stand out.": "",
  "Hoshino's Testimony": "",
  "Hoshino was alone in the office until 10pm last night. Genda arrived first thing in the morning and left the office after Hoshino came to work. Mafuyu entered after that, and lastly Saori. That's when Saori discovered that her cake was missing from the fridge.": "",
  "Mafuyu's Stomach Sounds": "",
  "When Mafuyu got to the office that morning, she was so hungry her stomach growled loudly. After that, Hoshino went to the bathroom and was not looking at the fridge for 15 minutes.": "",
  "Melted Ice": "",
  "All the ice cubes in Genda Law Office's freezer ended up melting for some reason.": "",
  "Ice in a Bowl": "",
  "Ice that was left at Koi Bride. It's in a bowl. Maybe to keep the sashimi cool?": "",
  "Koi Bride Carp": "",
  "Some carps in the fishing pond got turned into sashimi, while other fish survived.": "",
  "Charles Sandals": "",
  "The sandals Kaneda wears. For some reason, \"Charles\" is written on the heels.": "",
  "Kumakura's Bag": "",
  "Kumakura's bag. He refuses to let us see what's inside.": "",
  "Nishimura's Bag": "",
  "Nishimura the mascot's bag. It only has a wallet and a plush he won from the arcade.": "",
  "Poppo Showa MFLP": "",
  "Poppo's music fair prize, a record from Alice at the Showa branch.": "",
  "Poppo E. Shichifuku MFLP": "",
  "Poppo's music fair prize, a record from Nonomura at the E. Shichifuku branch.": "",
  "Poppo W. Shichifuku MFLP": "",
  "Poppo's music fair prize, a record from Asamura at the W. Shichifuku branch.": "",
  "Poppo Tenkaichi MFLP": "",
  "Poppo's music fair prize, a record from Dwayne at the Tenkaichi branch.": "",
  "Amidst a Dream LP": "",
  "A present from Sana. It's an album featuring her latest hit single.": "",
  "100 Chips": "",
  "Show them you mean business at the casino with a cool 100 chips.": "",
  "Dirty Clothes": "",
  "Dress like a bum, and most people on the street won't even look at you.": "",
  "10 Chips": "",
  "Have a little bit of fun at the casino tonight with a humble 10 chips.": "",
  "1,000 Chips": "",
  "Let the good times roll at the casino with a whopping 1,000 chips.": "",
  "10 Wooden Tags": "",
  "Give the games at the gambling hall a try with just 10 wooden tags.": "",
  "100 Wooden Tags": "",
  "Have a grand old time at the gambling hall with 100 wooden tags.": "",
  "1,000 Wooden Tags": "",
  "Play the night away at the gambling hall with 1,000 wooden tags.": "",
  "Boneless Short Rib": "",
  "Gyu-Kaku's signature: A whopping 2.4kg of 100% premium beef with unrivaled umami flavor!": "",
  "Salted Tongue": "",
  "Yakiniku always begins with the tongue! A rich and tasty salted tongue, that is.": "",
  "Harami King": "",
  "Gyu-Kaku's famously thick, tender, and juicy harami. It truly is the king of grilled meat!": "",
  "Honey Pepper Dwaeji Galbi": "",
  "Grilled pork rib cut from highly selective breeding of pigs marinated in luscious honey pepper sauce.": "",
  "Japanese Beef Ribs": "",
  "Every bite contains a rich and fathomless flavor, a hallmark of this special black wagyu kalbi.": "",
  "Luxury Marbled Salted Tongue": "",
  "A luxurious selection of meat using only the soft parts. Only eight pieces can be taken from a single cow.": "",
  "Handpicked Beef Course": "",
  "An array of Japanese beef ribs, marbled salted tongue, rib finger meat, and chuck steak.": "",
  "Matured Roast Steak": "",
  "An aged roast steak comprising only of the softest part of the shoulder.": "",
  "Cheese Fondue de Chicken Basil": "",
  "This chicken's scintillating essence of basil and creamy cheese will awaken the appetite.": "",
  "Plum Shiso Chilled Noodles": "",
  "Finish any meal with the sourness of plum, the fragrance of shiso, and the texture of noodles.": "",
  "White Rice with Kalbi": "",
  "A side of steamed white rice. It goes well with kalbi.": "",
  "An exquisite marriage of black honey and kinako. Gyu-Kaku's most popular dessert.": "",
  "Pilot Uniform": "",
  "A flight uniform assigned to airline pilots. You'd look awesome in it.": "",
  "A tuna figurine from Decor-oceans. Collect all 6 fishy friends from Series 1!": "",
  "A fugu figurine from Decor-oceans. Collect all 6 fishy friends from Series 1!": "",
  "A red snapper figurine from Decor-oceans. Collect all 6 fishy friends from Series 1!": "",
  "A salmon figurine from Decor-oceans. Collect all 6 fishy friends from Series 1!": "",
  "A blowfish figurine from Decor-oceans. Collect all 6 fishy friends from Series 1!": "",
  "A rare megalodon from Decor-oceans. You've found Series 1's secret figurine!": "",
  "A flounder figurine from Decor-oceans. Collect all 6 fishy friends from Series 2!": "",
  "A marlin figurine from Decor-oceans. Collect all 6 fishy friends from Series 2!": "",
  "A crab figurine from Decor-oceans. Collect all 6 fishy friends from Series 2!": "",
  "A goby figurine from Decor-oceans. Collect all 6 fishy friends from Series 2!": "",
  "A squid figurine from Decor-oceans. Collect all 6 fishy friends from Series 2!": "",
  "A rare coelacanth from Decor-oceans. You've found Series 2's secret figurine!": "",
  "Pawn": "",
  "A pawn from the Shogi Interior Series. Don't look back in life; just keep moving forward.": "",
  "Lance": "",
  "A lance from the Shogi Interior Series. The shortest path a man can take is a straight line.": "",
  "Knight": "",
  "A knight from the Shogi Interior Series. Fear not the weapon but the hand that wields it.": "",
  "Silver General": "",
  "A silver general from the Shogi Interior Series. The jack of all trades, master of none.": "",
  "Gold General": "",
  "A gold general from the Shogi Interior Series. The best offense is a good defense.": "",
  "Bishop": "",
  "A bishop from the Shogi Interior Series. Genius is 1% inspiration and 99% perspiration.": "",
  "Rook": "",
  "A rook from the Shogi Interior Series. In the end, the winner is the last man standing.": "",
  "Champion King": "",
  "A champion's king from the Shogi Interior Series. The game can't start without its champ!": "",
  "Challenger King": "",
  "A challenger king from the Shogi Interior Series. Always lurking in the champion's shadow...": "",
  "Horse Figurine": "",
  "An equestrian decoration. I wonder if the Horseplayer Detective has one...? Nah.": "",
  "Ebisu Figurine": "",
  "One of the Seven Gods of Fortune. That kindly old smile always puts me at ease.": "",
  "Desktop Houseplant": "",
  "A plant can contribute to a tranquil office space. It's small enough to put anywhere.": "",
  "Artificial Flower": "",
  "A fake blossom. Made to add a splash of color to one's interior decorations.": "",
  "Pine Tree Bonsai": "",
  "How much TLC did it take to grow a bonsai tree into a grand pine?": "",
  "Chinese Vase": "",
  "This antique has an imperial presence, which sets a nice mood for the room.": "",
  "Decorative Plate": "",
  "This regal interior decoration is adorned with autumn leaves.": "",
  "Painting: Autumn Avenue": "",
  "This impressionistic work of art makes me feel nostalgic for some reason.": "",
  "Painting: Mountain Reflection": "",
  "This photorealistic work of art depicts a scene of natural beauty at a lake.": "",
  "Daruma (Red)": "",
  "A red daruma doll. Put it on display, and it's bound to catch people's eyes.": "",
  "Daruma (White)": "",
  "A white daruma doll. I didn't realize there were so many different kinds.": "",
  "Daruma (Blue)": "",
  "A blue daruma doll. I didn't realize there were so many different kinds.": "",
  "Rubber Baseball": "",
  "A ball with a rubber center. I haven't swung a baseball bat in ages...": "",
  "Every kid has one. Also known as a football, depending on who you ask.": "",
  "Fishing Float": "",
  "I'm no fisherman, but I guess I could use this bobber as decoration.": "",
  "Artisanal Shogi Set": "",
  "First-class shogi board and pieces, handcrafted from mahagony and other fine materials.": "",
  "Jack Daniel's": "",
  "America's favorite Tennessee Whiskey. Its sweet, oaky flavor sets it apart from everyday bourbon.": "",
  "Jack Daniel's Single Barrel": "",
  "This one-of-a-kind drink sports the richness and defining smoothness of single barrel whiskies.": "",
  "Jack Daniel's Gold": "",
  "This double mellowed, double barreled Tennessee Whiskey is luxurious and extra smooth.": "",
  "Bushmills": "",
  "This traditional Irish whiskey blends single malt and grain whiskies for a fresh fruitiness.": "",
  "Bushmills Black Bush": "",
  "This Irish whiskey is 80% matured malt liquor and is defined by its ripe, fruity flavors.": "",
  "Bushmills 10 Year-Old Single Malt": "",
  "Matured in bourbon barrels for a decade, this Irish whiskey delivers a complex sweetness.": "",
  "Bunnahabhain 12 Year Old": "",
  "This single malt Scotch whisky is distilled without peat for a nutty taste and a coastal vibe.": "",
  "America's favorite Tennessee Whiskey. Its sweet, oaky flavor sets it apart from bourbon.": "",
  "Early Times Yellow Label": "",
  "The globally beloved bourbon whisky. It has a sharp, simple taste with sweet undertones.": "",
  "Asahi Jurokucha": "",
  "A tea blended from sixteen eastern medicinal ingredients for a low-calorie, caffeine-free thirst-quencher.": "",
  "Asahi Rokujo Barley Tea": "",
  "Using six-row barley to its full extent, this authentic tea extracts the natural sweetness and aroma.": "",
  "Wonda Morning Shot": "",
  "Easy to drink and eye-openingly bitter. A canned morning coffee perfect to start off the day.": "",
  "Wonda Gold Low Sugar": "",
  "A low-sugar premium canned coffee packed with caffeine for an afternoon pick-me-up.": "",
  "Mitsuya Cider": "",
  "A carbonated apple drink born in Japan and beloved by its people for over 130 years.": "",
  "Bireley's Orange": "",
  "A tireless classic perfected for over 60 years. Its fresh-squeezed juice combines a groveside scent with the taste of ripe fruit.": "",
  "Wilkinson Soda": "",
  "A carbonated soft drink that tastes sharp and clear. It offers a refreshing flavor with an edge.": "",
  "Dodekamin": "",
  "An energy drink that blows your fatigue away with twelve types of energizing ingredients and fizzy stimulation.": "",
  "Kinkuro": "",
  "This creamy shochu's Kagoshima-grown sweet potatoes give it a clear, rich aftertaste.": "",
  "Asahi Super Dry": "",
  "A dry beer with a sharp crispness that goes down smooth thanks to its refined flavor.": "",
  "Asahi Super Dry (Bottle)": "",
  "Asahi Orion Draft": "",
  "A refreshing Okinawan draft beer that's easy to drink yet still has substance.": "",
  "Camus VSOP Elegance": "",
  "A cognac using brandy that was matured in oak barrels. It boasts a fruity mellowness.": "",
  "Camus XO Elegance": "",
  "Packaged in a classy bottle, this cognac blends floral and vanilla undertones with rich flavors.": "",
  "Camus XO Borderies": "",
  "A single-cru cognac from the Borderies region, known for rare and richly aromatic cognacs.": "",
  "Jose Cuervo Especial Silver": "",
  "The finest tequila from the world's leading brand. Enjoy the refreshing taste of agave and lime.": "",
  "Nikka Whisky Black Clear": "",
  "A refreshing, easy-to-drink whisky with a silky-smooth aroma and mellow taste.": "",
  "Ben Nevis Single Malt 10 Years": "",
  "Scotland's crowning Scotch whisky has won many awards for its aromatic, mellow taste.": "",
  "Super Nikka": "",
  "This whisky is balanced and smooth. Made in honor of Masataka Taketsuru's late wife, Rita.": "",
  "Taketsuru Pure Malt": "",
  "Named after the father of Japanese whisky, Masataka Taketsuru. It is gentle and mellow.": "",
  "Yoichi Single Malt": "",
  "This single malt whisky from idyllic Yoichi, Hokkaido offers an array of complex tastes.": "",
  "The Nikka 12 Years Old": "",
  "This bottle was blended from whiskies aged over 12 years into a true malt experience.": "",
  "Nikka Whisky from the Barrel": "",
  "This unique whisky is 51% alcohol. It exhibits a strong flavor with a rich, deep aroma.": "",
  "Miyagikyo Single Malt": "",
  "Distilled in Sendai, the City of Trees. This single malt sports an elegantly fruity taste.": "",
  "Nikka Coffey Grain Whisky": "",
  "Created in Nikka's traditional still; vanilla and chocolate harmonize with the oaken taste.": "",
  "Nikka Coffey Gin": "",
  "Gin made in Nikka's traditional still. It has citrus notes and a whiff of Japanese pepper.": "",
  "Nikka Coffey Vodka": "",
  "This vodka uses the classic Nikka process to conjure floral notes and caramel undertones.": "",
  "Abundant Oil": "",
  "An abundant amount of oil that can be used for drone part materials.": "",
  "Spirit of Steel": "",
  "A book with instructions on how to effectively withstand attacks and land counterattacks.": "",
  "This secret technique has unlocked Resolute Counter. Learn how to use it from the Skill App.": "",
  "Secret Technique: Running Palm Strike": "",
  "A guide to quickly closing in on an enemy and striking their chin with the heel of one's palm.": "",
  "This secret technique has unlocked EX Running Palm Strike. Learn how to use it on the Skill App.": "",
  "Secret Technique: Running Assault": "",
  "A guide to maneuvering through enemies before knocking them back with a powerful blow.": "",
  "This secret technique has unlocked EX Running Assault. Learn how to use it on the Skill App.": "",
  "Spiritual Awakening": ""
 },
